 "remarks": "Amazing opportunity to own this 2 bedroom 1.5 bathroom townhome in West Norwalk. All brand new LVP flooring was just installed. Beautiful contemporary master bathroom completely redone 2 years ago. Half bath also renovated 2 years ago as well.... and the 1st floor of the townhouse was painted yesterday. Spacious living/dining room open concept with a cozy fireplace and sliders to a private deck. Unusually large eat-in kitchen with updated stainless steel appliances. 2 large bedrooms share the full en suite bathroom on the 2nd floor.  Fillow Ridge is a beautiful, secluded and quiet development that is well maintained and close to everything Norwalk has to offer!",
